// Step 1: look for an “action landmark”
R ← {actions whose effects include a literal in φ}
generate RPG from s0 using A \ R, stopping when $\hat{s}_k = \hat{s}_{k-1}$
// $\hat{s}_k$ now includes every atom that’s achievable without R
N ← {all actions in R that are r-applicable in $\hat{s}_k$}
if N = ∅ then return failure

// Step 2: get new landmarks from actions’ preconditions
$\Phi \leftarrow \{p_1 \lor p_2 \lor \ldots \lor p_m \mid m \leq 4,$
each $p_i$ is a precondition of at least one a ∈ N, and
each a ∈ N has at least one $p_i$ as a precondition}
append to Queue every φ ∈ Φ that isn’t subsumed by another φ' ∈ Φ
add φ to Examined
